国","sourceUrl":"https://www.ign.com.cn/grand-theft-auto-6/64094/xia-dao-xi-che-shou-6-you-xi-ping-ce-10-fen-ign-zhong-guo","publishedAt":"2026-11-18T11:00:37.000Z","sourceIconUrl":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/b7a873a003fab6992da8.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":null,"firstParty":false,"available":true,"image":{"url":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/a0c3ec6843c7aedb5585.jpg","srcSet":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/a0c3ec6843c7aedb5585.jpg 336w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/e87547c8ae66e83363db.jpg 720w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/6905dfc631d81f0f1a44.jpg 1200w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/a2eedeca5f8b20dc68dc.jpg 1600w","width":3840,"height":2160,"alt":null,"sourceUrl":"https://www.ign.com.cn/grand-theft-auto-6/64094/xia-dao-xi-che-shou-6-you-xi-ping-ce-10-fen-ign-zhong-guo","type":"article"}},{"itemId":"cdrcvuaezpsiqhtw5ac42e93r","title":"GTA6 评测：80小时体验后称其不负盛名，11月19日登陆PS5和Xbox","summary":"The Verge作者在体验近80小时后评测《GTA6》，认为游戏结合了GTA5的开放自由与荒野大镖客2的沉浸感，并有所超越。Jason与Lucia的双主角恋爱故事、新的检查点系统和丰富的世界细节是亮点；战斗手感仍笨重且有少量bug，但首发版PS5上运行正常。游戏于11月19日发售，登陆PS5和Xbox。","sourceName":"The Verge 游戏","sourceUrl":"https://www.theverge.com/games/1035801/grand-theft-auto-6-review","publishedAt":"2026-11-18T11:00:00.000Z","sourceIconUrl":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c7.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":null,"firstParty":false,"available":true,"image":{"url":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/ea9d290819663eae5b12.webp","srcSet":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/ea9d290819663eae5b12.webp 336w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/3d665166b6f40e09601b.webp 720w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/98fbde52881c4a6ee424.webp 1200w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/f21f4efccbc01c4e0628.webp 1600w","width":3840,"height":2160,"alt":null,"sourceUrl":"https://www.theverge.com/games/1035801/grand-theft-auto-6-review","type":"article"}},{"itemId":"ib07l9d3mdmasaeca5rbx6088","title":"《侠盗猎车手6》发售前一手试玩：双主角、日常抢劫与销赃玩法体验","summary":"巴哈姆特电玩疯编辑在 Rockstar 安排下试玩了 11 月 19 日上市的《侠盗猎车手6》（PS5/Xbox Series X|S），以 PS5 Pro 游玩约 60 多小时，称推进至主线约 70% 花了 50 余小时且体验稳定无迟滞。","sourceName":"巴哈姆特 GNN","sourceUrl":"https://gnn.gamer.com.tw/detail.php?sn=315247","publishedAt":"2026-11-18T11:00:01.000Z","sourceIconUrl":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/26d98f39f43d4c5139be.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":null,"firstParty":false,"available":true,"image":{"url":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/ac3d78b626f9d34d486d.webp","srcSet":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/ac3d78b626f9d34d486d.webp 336w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/85c03d95284fcb37cff7.webp 720w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/c62413b4eb8c10ac077c.webp 1200w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/7cc92f79712feb710141.webp 1600w","width":2160,"height":2160,"alt":null,"sourceUrl":"https://gnn.gamer.com.tw/detail.php?sn=315247","type":"article"}},{"itemId":"rrxbifxlr07h2n6u1sxp49bn0","title":"《GTA6》机核提前体验评测：PS5版约30fps，双主角叙事与犯罪侧写系统详解","summary":"机核受邀提前体验《GTA6》完整内容，评测基于约70小时通关主线，主要使用普通版PS5，帧率大致在25至30fps之间波动，PS5 Pro基本维持30fps且光影更细腻，游戏不提供画质或性能模式选择。评测详细介绍了杰森与露西亚的双主角日常、好感度与家庭储蓄机制、新增的犯罪侧写系统，以及依赖目击者和监控的身份追查机制，同时指出掩体判定不稳、驾驶拥堵等不足，并称赞中文本地化质量。","sourceName":"机核","sourceUrl":"https://www.gcores.com/articles/222499","publishedAt":"2026-11-18T11:00:00.000Z","sourceIconUrl":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/af8e00f343cd85320c49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":null,"firstParty":false,"available":true,"image":{"url":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/cf454daa8e73280c6896.jpg","srcSet":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/cf454daa8e73280c6896.jpg 336w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/7edddaba51733c7c0bca.jpg 720w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/92a606c23e1b0daacd9e.jpg 1200w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/b6661b653292fdfcced7.jpg 1600w","width":3840,"height":2160,"alt":null,"sourceUrl":"https://www.gcores.com/articles/222499","type":"article"}}]}],"flashes":[{"itemId":"yf3fasor75rxtf5unbl3gfgbe","title":"索尼要求安装 PS5 v14.23.00 固件更新才能运行《GTA 6》","summary":"索尼确认玩家需安装 PS5 v14.23.00 系统更新才能游玩《GTA 6》，该更新约 1.3GB。PlayStation 支持页面建议在 11 月 19 日午夜前下载完成，以便在 11 月 19 日发售当天直接游玩。作者称索尼通常允许玩家在新固件强制前有一段宽限期，此次做法前所未有，并可能与 PS5 安全漏洞被破解有关。","sourceName":"Push Square","sourceUrl":"https://www.pushsquare.com/news/2026/11/gta-6-requires-new-ps5-firmware-update-to-play","publishedAt":"2026-11-18T02:00:00.000Z","sourceIconUrl":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/036602c754c94f7b7a2e.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":null,"firstParty":false,"available":true,"image":{"url":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/209c5ef43c9a0cfb6623.webp","srcSet":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/209c5ef43c9a0cfb6623.webp 336w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/47e8c9d6fcf824cef050.webp 720w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/7501ddc3918e320817c0.webp 1200w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/eef211e27a248635195f.webp 1600w","width":1280,"height":720,"alt":"","sourceUrl":"https://www.pushsquare.com/news/2026/11/gta-6-requires-new-ps5-firmware-update-to-play","type":"article"},"otherSources":5,"storyId":"50d93037-2cb5-4f99-a8d4-3993546b5834"},{"itemId":"po4pa42csg46gcpkz6zdo4dky","title":"GTA 6 Xbox Series X 评测：开放世界惊人，主线约40小时完整可达100小时以上","summary":"Pure Xbox发布GTA 6的Xbox Series X评测，认为其开放世界细节和规模远超GTA 5，是作者体验过的最惊人开放世界。主线赶工约40小时，配合可选内容约60至100小时以上；Xbox Series X上画面出色、帧率多为30FPS但流畅，仅偶有贴图延迟和少量小bug。","sourceName":"Pure Xbox","sourceUrl":"https://www.purexbox.com/reviews/xbox-series-x/grand-theft-auto-6","publishedAt":"2026-11-18T11:00:00.000Z","sourceIconUrl":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/43bcb3e2e8796a6db827.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":null,"firstParty":false,"available":true,"image":{"url":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/3b5fdfc5fc65d9936dc8.webp","srcSet":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/3b5fdfc5fc65d9936dc8.webp 336w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/fb2700424ebe1d4d4a62.webp 720w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/deb6c88896469d6c4a05.webp 1200w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/deb6c88896469d6c4a05.webp 1600w","width":900,"height":506,"alt":null,"sourceUrl":"https://www.purexbox.com/reviews/xbox-series-x/grand-theft-auto-6","type":"article"}},{"itemId":"rp7kaw1gjsywe906yx8pekdy5","title":"《GTA 6》发售日实机演示：15分钟首个正式任务玩法","summary":"IGN随《GTA 6》在新西兰时区解锁发售，发布了一段约15分钟的首个正式任务实机演示。内容为短序章之后的部分，展示Jason与朋友Cal、Donnie在虚构佛罗里达群岛Key Lento附近完成一次运毒行动，包含水面画面、潜行击倒与枪战混合玩法，IGN同时提供无剧透评测和通关时长等内容。","sourceName":"IGN","sourceUrl":"https://www.ign.com/articles/gta-6-15-minutes-of-first-mission-gameplay","publishedAt":"2026-11-18T11:20:00.000Z","sourceIconUrl":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/26bba8ae1b41a9b1dbaa.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":null,"firstParty":false,"available":true,"image":{"url":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/cbd7ab93100d48465e27.jpg","srcSet":"https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/cbd7ab93100d48465e27.jpg 336w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/3f440d423b1cb4729021.jpg 720w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/e0e0701a53e3dae8193c.jpg 1200w, https://qwerwanghao.github.io/gamehot-pages/media/6ceab9401c75747bc267.jpg 1600w","width":1280,"height":720,"alt":null,"sourceUrl":"https://www.ign.com/articles/gta-6-15-minutes-of-first-mission-gameplay","type":"article"}},{"itemId":"t8ihmnrmn04xuilg86m8qqdyj","title":"GTA 6 全球发售引发“GTA流感”，多国报道预计大量员工学生请假","summary":"GTA 6 全球发售之际，所谓“GTA流感”在网络上流行，英国 NHS 在 Instagram 提醒玩家长游戏时定期休息、注意重复性劳损（RSI）。","sourceName":"IGN","sourceUrl":"https://www.ign.com/articles/gta-flu-trends-online-as-reports-suggest-thousands-will-skip-school-and-call-in-sick-at-work-with-a-measurab